From 98f2dd58fae2960b5755c575988926f852d06b9f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: gambtho <Thomas.Gamble@microsoft.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 00:04:39 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] app: Allow a separate backend application name

Let product builds set a consistent backend name for server-side
diagnostics without changing Electron display names or profiles.

Validate the optional manifest field during packaging and startup, and
keep the existing Electron name fallback when it is omitted.
---
